          "description": "3/day, a death hornet shoots out black needles towards a single target within a 30-ft. range and must make a ranged touch attack (+17) to inflict 8d4 points of non-elemental damage. The creature must make a Fortitude save (DC 20) or gain the Paralyzed status effect for 1d4 rounds. This is considered a poison effect. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 4th level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 23).",
