          "description": "A death hornet shoots out green needles towards a single target within a 30-ft. range and must make a ranged touch attack (+17) to inflict 2d4 points of non-elemental damage. The creature must make a Fortitude save (DC 18) or gain the Poison status effect, taking 1d4 points of non-elemental damage per round for 1d4 rounds. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 1st level spell (Knowledge: Arcana DC 17).",
